            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Interestingly enough, it was already suggested in #12. Using `Alt + hjkl` is in somewhat of a \"mode\" in itself as `Alt` can be pressed. And creating splits seems not that inconvenient with built-in `<C-w> + sv`.\r\n\r\nWhat exactly do you feel is troublesome in Neovim with resizing windows?",
